[156.699822, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   + clampN (digA1 a) (radB1 f) * (radB2 f * radB3 f)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   + clampN (digA2 a) (radB2 f) * radB3 f\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   + clampN (digA3 a) (radB3 f)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> def debitN (a f : Nat) : Nat := a / 2 + encN a f / 2\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> def candidateSpec : AuthorizationSpec where\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   accepts := fun b a f => debitN a.toNat f.toNat ≤ b.toNat\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   output := fun _b a f t => t.toNat = debitN a.toNat f.toNat\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
